DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The wwbbnngg driver provides support for the Winbond W83793G Hardware Moni‐
     tor.  The device provides 10 voltage sensors, 6 temperature sensors and
     12 fan sensors.  Sensor values are made available through the sysctl(8)
     interface.

